# Spell Queller's enters ability exiles a creature spell at its limit: Bot2's Argothian Elder, mana value exactly 4. When
# Bot2's Bolt kills the Queller, its leaves-the-battlefield ability asks Bot2, the Elder's owner, whether to cast it
# (CR 608.2g, a "may"); Bot2 declines, and the Elder stays in exile, never to be cast (it cannot wait, the ruling).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Spell Queller
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Argothian Elder
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x14

[Actions]
