Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile = Argothian Elder
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Spell Queller)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Decline
[Bot2.Main2]

